{
  "body" : "You are designing a soft, emotional anime-style winter portrait.\n\nCONTENT BRIEF\n- Primary subject: {{subject}}\n- Backdrop setting: {{setting}}\n- Text or tagline: {{copy}}\n\nSTYLE DIRECTION\n- Genre / medium: anime-style digital illustration\n- Composition: portrait orientation (2:3 aspect ratio), shallow depth of field with blurred background and focused foreground subject\n- Lens / camera: close-up perspective with emphasis on hand and object; soft bokeh effect\n- Lighting: diffuse, indirect lighting with a cool color temperature; soft highlights and gentle contrasts\n- Color palette and grading: cool winter tones (white, pale blue) accented by vibrant pops of saturated color (e.g., flowers or objects held by the subject)\n- Texture / surface: smooth, polished digital textures with subtle gradients and soft edges\n- Post-processing: soft bloom and bokeh particles; snowflake details scattered throughout the frame\n- Mood: tender, melancholic, hopeful, serene\n- References: Makoto Shinkai-inspired lighting and atmosphere, Kyoto Animation-style character rendering\n\nDESIGN RULES\n- Aspect: 2:3 portrait (~1024×1536), suitable for vertical display or storytelling\n- Focus on the foreground subject with blurred background elements; ensure the emotional resonance through gesture and color contrasts\n- Maintain a balance between detailed foreground and simplified background for clarity\n\nAVOID\n- Harsh, direct lighting\n- Overly busy backgrounds competing with the subject\n- Excessive saturation or neon colors\n- Lack of emotional connection in the composition\n- Flat, lifeless textures\n- Inconsistent bokeh or snowflake quality\n\nAdditional constraints: {{extra}}\n\n——————\nSubject: {{subject}}\nSetting: {{setting}}\nCopy: {{copy}}\nExtra notes: {{extra}}",
